    DRAFT - Spanish (Spain) interface strings, awaiting review by a
    native-speaking sailor. This folder lives outside res/ on purpose: a
    values-es folder in res/ ships to every phone set to Spanish the moment it
    is merged. tools/check_ui_drafts.py checks keys, placeholders and escapes,
    and writes catalog/i18n/es-ui-review.md for the reviewer.

    Agreed: "tú"; nav_log = Historial (bitácora / diario de navegación is the
    voyage log); lockers = pañoles (tambucho is a hatch in Spain).
-->
